<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="guide">
  <h1>How to use Hope Scholar</h1>
  <p class="lead">A short video tour of the real app, from search to tracking your application, with a spoken guide. Captions are built in, so it also works with the sound off.</p>
  <div class="guide-video">
    <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster="/media/guide-poster.jpg" aria-describedby="guide-steps">
      <source src="/media/guide.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      Your browser cannot play this video. The steps are written below.
    </video>
  </div>
  <h2 id="guide-steps">The steps in writing</h2>
  <ol class="guide-steps">
    <li><b>Search.</b> Type a word such as "refugee" or "master's" on the home page, then use the filters for field, level, country and deadline. Everything is undergraduate level and above.</li>
    <li><b>Open a scholarship.</b> You see who can apply, what it covers and the honest deadline note. The apply button opens the official website and shows its real address.</li>
    <li><b>Create your account.</b> Use your email, or tap "Sign up with Google" for one click (when Google sign-in is switched on).</li>
    <li><b>Fill in your profile.</b> Choose your level, field, country and financial need once. The app uses it to match scholarships to you.</li>
    <li><b>Check your dashboard.</b> It shows recommended scholarships with a match score and the reasons.</li>
    <li><b>Save and get reminders.</b> Tap "Save scholarship", choose when to be reminded, and add the deadline you find on the official site.</li>
    <li><b>Track your application.</b> After you apply on the official site, set the status and add notes on the Applications page.</li>
    <li><b>Ask for help.</b> The Help button answers questions about the app and, when switched on, anything else you ask.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="guide-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/register">Create free account</a> <a class="btn btn-lg" href="/scholarships">Browse scholarships</a></p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
